WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:09.100 --> 00:00:12.000
Something inside me has always been there

00:00:13.660 --> 00:00:14.780
But now it's awake

00:00:16.900 --> 00:00:18.100
And I need help

00:00:23.520 --> 00:00:24.540
Let the past die

00:00:26.940 --> 00:00:27.940
Kill it

00:00:30.820 --> 00:00:31.960
If you have to

00:00:33.980 --> 00:00:36.160
That's the only way to become what you were meant to be

00:00:41.220 --> 00:00:45.100
I need someone, to show me my place in all this

00:00:49.380 --> 00:00:52.140
I've seen this raw strength only once before

00:00:53.040 --> 00:00:54.860
It didn't scare me enough then

00:00:56.040 --> 00:00:57.300
It does now

00:01:13.440 --> 00:01:14.880
Fulfill

00:01:15.445 --> 00:01:16.445
Your

00:01:16.695 --> 00:01:17.695
Destiny

